# ANDYL OS — wireless networking
#
# AOS server/cloud images do not support Wi-Fi today. Leaving cfg80211
# built in without regulatory.db available in the initrd makes every boot
# emit a failed firmware-load warning, even though no WLAN driver is enabled.
# Keep the wireless stack disabled until a profile deliberately adds Wi-Fi
# hardware support and the matching regulatory database plumbing.

# CONFIG_WIRELESS is not set
# CONFIG_WLAN is not set
# CONFIG_CFG80211 is not set
# CONFIG_MAC80211 is not set
# CONFIG_RFKILL is not set
